include fixture.praat
# THE SCATTER PLOT, BOTH AXES PINNED TO THE DATA. x runs 1..12 and y runs
# 10..120, stated as the axis, so the four extreme points sit on the four
# edges. The second case, beside the line chart, that pins the rectangle from
# the inside on all four sides -- and it does it with markers rather than a
# stroke, which is a different drawing command reaching the same corners.
@bgSetType: 8
@bgPress
@bgSave: "left right bottom top"
